SUMMARY:Model Mondays - Train and customize open models with Fireworks on 
 Foundry
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nMore than 90% of enterprise data re
 sides in internal systems and records. In this session\, learn how Firewor
 ks brings model customization to Azure AI Foundry as a first-party service
 .\n\nDeploy open models from the Foundry catalog\, train them on your data
 \, and serve them through your Azure subscription using existing identity\
 , governance\, and billing controls.\n---\n\n* Explore the Resources https
 ://github.com/microsoft/model-mondays\n* Read the Newsletter https://aka.m
 s/model-mondays/newsletter\n* Continue the conversation on the Discord htt
 ps://aka.ms/model-mondays/discord\n\n[event ID:27576]
