SUMMARY:Modernize Databases Faster with AI-Assisted Migration and Optimiza
 tion
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nDatabase modernization has never ha
 d a magic button. Migrations can take weeks or months of converting code\,
  resolving incompatibilities\, and validating that applications still work
  as expected. AI is changing that. In this session\, we’ll use Visual St
 udio Code\, Microsoft Foundry\, and GitHub Copilot to accelerate an end-to
 -end migration to PostgreSQL on Azure HorizonDB.\n\nWe’ll assess the exi
 sting application\, convert schemas and SQL code\, fix migration gaps\, an
 d progressively validate data\, application logic\, business behavior\, an
 d workloads.\n\nThrough a practical\, end-to-end migration\, we’ll show 
 how AI can accelerate database modernization and help teams migrate faster
  and with greater confidence.\n\n-----------------------------------------
 ---------------\n\nCheck out the series - https://aka.ms/ModernizefasteSer
 ies\n\n[eventID:27666]
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3168
 74003/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261006T211909Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T211909Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
