SUMMARY:Build Your First Copilot Plugin with WorkIQ Developer Tools
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nGo hands-on with WorkIQ Developer T
 ools as we walk through building your first Copilot plugin\, from setup to
  a working extension.\n\nWe’ll use a WIQD Cookbook recipe as part of the
  walkthrough\, showing how these practical\, easy-to-follow guides can hel
 p developers turn WorkIQ concepts into working solutions and reuse proven 
 patterns for their own scenarios.\n\nGet started: https://microsoft.github
 .io/wiqd\n\nPractical guide: https://aka.ms/wiqd/cookbooks
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3165
 89243/
