DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261028T150000
SUMMARY:Build a Cloud-Native Foundation for AI with Azure Red Hat OpenShif
 t
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nWhat does it take to build a cloud-
 native platform foundation for modern applications and AI workloads?\n\nJo
 in us to explore Azure Red Hat OpenShift (ARO) and the role of open-source
  Kubernetes in your platform strategy. We’ll introduce ARO\, explore hos
 ted control planes\, and discuss how OpenShift Virtualization brings virtu
 al machines onto a cloud-native platform alongside containerized applicati
 ons.\n\nAlong the way\, we’ll examine ARO’s security posture and platf
 orm considerations for financial services and other highly regulated indus
 tries. Leave with a clearer understanding of ARO’s capabilities and how 
 to evaluate it as part of your application modernization and AI infrastruc
 ture strategy.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3168
 54156/
